-- 
Bubba is at the police station being interviewed. One of the
officers says, "You say you were with your cousins when one
of them shot you. Would you care to state what happened?"

"Well, We wuz havin' a good time drinking, when my cousin
Ray picked up his shotgun and said, 'Hey, derennyya fellas
wanna go huntin'?'"

"And then what happened?"

"From what I remember ... I stood up and said, 'Sure, I'm
game.'"

